#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:22
msgid ""
"BuddyPress Job Manager connects WP Job Manager to BuddyPress, adding "
"dedicated Jobs and Resumes tabs to member profiles so employers and "
"candidates can work entirely from their profile."
msgstr ""
"BuddyPress Job Manager conecta WP Job Manager a BuddyPress, agregando "
"pestañas dedicadas de Empleos y Currículums a los perfiles de los miembros "
"para que los empleadores y candidatos puedan trabajar completamente desde su "
"perfil."

#: includes/admin/views/welcome.php:25
msgid "There is nothing to configure to get started. A member who posts a job gets a Jobs tab, a member who publishes a resume gets a Resumes tab, and their resume appears on their profile. Use the General tab only to control activity-feed updates and application notifications."
msgstr "No hay nada que configurar para empezar. Un miembro que publica un empleo obtiene una pestaña Empleos, un miembro que publica un currículum obtiene una pestaña Currículums, y su currículum aparece en su perfil. Usa la pestaña General solo para controlar las actualizaciones de actividad y las notificaciones de candidatura."

